# Allowlist: only source needed for the backend image enters the build context.
# Private config, state, secrets, media and build output never do.
*
!Dockerfile
!apps/sidekick/package.json
!apps/sidekick/package-lock.json
!apps/sidekick/*.js
!apps/sidekick/*.mjs
!apps/sidekick/ui/
!apps/sidekick/static/index.html
!apps/sidekick/static/app.css
!apps/sidekick/static/icon.svg
!apps/sidekick/static/manifest.webmanifest
!apps/wall/static/
!backend/web/app.py
!backend/web/requirements.txt
